{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80a5ba49b1a90b0aa25f0e70ceb447990d45bf635636cd8e444c673ec4ffe6ce",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc9c5be11dd10f3ea9ccd341540acf50cead6d0b7d92978ddd7b2f4697fc2d49",
      "text": "各自的分歧点",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49457f9041404978f4cfb32906c3b373a1da4514b3f3d219f8bd909a12b566e7",
      "text": "作为父亲的影子写手的一希，正为当下的境遇苦恼不已。另一方面，过着学生生活的大吾从同班同学那里得知了女性偶像凉的事情，对偶像产生了兴趣。凉则为了推好友一把，站在了下定重大决心的舞台上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000009:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000009:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc9c5be11dd10f3ea9ccd341540acf50cead6d0b7d92978ddd7b2f4697fc2d49",
      "text": "各自的分歧点",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62ceeb9f11af5c5604ab59d7ccbbc324df1931a3c27c6290d4856dff1dd0a2e9",
      "text": "…听得到树木的嘈杂之声。\n这应该，是我心境所致吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7d03a022948b24c32d55828191c37aa09a1d355de2af8085dbaf8bf4baa74a7",
      "text": "（…虽说是出来换换心情，但果然还是不行。\n就像今天这样，做了影子写手工作的日子）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c43de2abd57dcf1de5618baea12b82ee87869398d2d73234f031e68f9c19529b",
      "text": "（…父亲，去哪里了呢。\n去书房给他送原稿，但他不在呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0aba9b5191596592527b5a2eaee4626e390cd14f02b56f2444f53b7834046804",
      "text": "（…说起来，最后一次碰面是什么时候了？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a64d5152f2bb47cc9dfde6930a83b0584b69f2dcff31cdd77f6640e3b9ed22a3",
      "text": "（…对了，那是和今天一样，\n完成了父亲的原稿的那一天）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33c9d0c9794a2a7c5b0bdd595242ad06dc76c86c087c37c3b464bc9f9f3a8ebe",
      "text": "…明明是一家人，\n居然能这么久都不碰面啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a76d8fb94b5c27aa31fafba90fc2c9a0640099592c656e8aee0f452349914fc1",
      "text": "（…在我小的时候，并不是这样的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a420d2c24b98da6d6397e5ebdfc5c9964789ac440437862476203396a5b704f",
      "text": "（…父亲会把自己写的书，读给我听）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5cd7847313e7604dfd9b6fb118855c3317bb30a241c4468f2f573baffdf0109",
      "text": "（…我写的作文，\n他也会夸我写得好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb24956c5a58ccfaba140b0430bd1e3a42f4264f6bb447d77afc0159bb8d95d0",
      "text": "（…被夸奖固然开心，\n但最让我开心的，莫过于能让他感到高兴）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
